        2.2 TOOLS AND TECHNOLOGIES 
    Ensure you have access to and install the following tools and technologies: 
 
A)  CI/CD and Deployment Tools: 
•	Jenkins: Installed and configured on the CI/CD server to automate the build, test, security scanning, and deployment processes. 
•	Plugins: GitHub Integration, Docker Pipeline, SonarQube Scanner, Email Extension, and Trivy. 
